<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

The per-root reconcile routes a live carrier to its owner's flush, a dropped one to each mirror's unlink, and every root to the orphan pass. The residency bar (`neverOnDisk`) and the pack-member suppress decide what never reaches disk. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

